-- «K3» fragment 5 of 8 -- candidate index 852 of 1709
--
--   source   linux/lib/percpu-refcount.c:63-105   (Linux 7.2.0-rc7, db2ddb87143519e2)
--   function percpu_ref_init
--   picked   by the rule in `messung/K3-AUSWAHL.md`
--
-- **NOT MEASURED AT THE TIME OF THIS COMMIT.**
--
-- ## The excerpt, verbatim
--
